    "description": "Inbound Tech Inc. engages in the multilingual CRM and sales outsourcing businesses in Japan. The company offers multilingual contact center services comprising interpretation services, including telephone, AI/video, and three-way interpretation, as well as multilingual customer support; and multilingual solutions, such as medical interpreter and homestay support. It also provides contact center BPO services; specialized sales outsourcing services; and healthcare business services. The company offers its services in various languages, including Japanese, English, Chinese, Korean, Portuguese, Spanish, Thai, Vietnamese, Russian, French, Tagalog, Nepali, and Indonesian. It serves multinational corporations and foreign-affiliated companies. The company was formerly known as Brainpress Inc. and changed its name to Inbound Tech Inc. in September 2017. Inbound Tech Inc. was founded in 2009 and is headquartered in Shinjuku, Japan."
